c --- Shift+AltGr layer (Rule 5 static second-series consonants) ---
+ [SHIFT RALT K_Q] > U+1788
+ [SHIFT RALT K_T] > U+1791
+ [SHIFT RALT K_P] > U+1797
+ [SHIFT RALT K_D] > U+178C
+ [SHIFT RALT K_F] > U+1792
+ [SHIFT RALT K_G] > U+17A2
